flowchart TD
    %% Engine::origin_poll_tick, run by run_origin_poller
    tick([Tick]) --> due{Domain due?}
    due -->|no| sleep[Wait with jitter]
    due -->|yes| update[origin_update]
    update --> changed[Upstream changed paths]
    changed --> merge[merge_file per path]
    merge --> apply[Apply, delete or keep local]
    merge --> conflict[Record a conflict]
    apply & conflict --> state[OriginPollerState]
    state --> report[status_report origins block]
    sleep --> tick
    state --> tick
